---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="About & Background">
	<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-12">

		<!-- Header -->
		<div class="space-y-4 border-b border-slate-800 pb-8">
			<div class="text-xs text-brand-accent font-bold tracking-wider">// SYSTEM_PROFILE // ABOUT</div>
			<h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
				Aleksandr Zhdanov
			</h1>
			<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
				Systems & MLOps Infrastructure Engineer, Computer Vision & Robotics Specialist based in St. Petersburg, Russia. Focused on bridging the gap between experimental deep learning research and fault-tolerant production deployments.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Core Trajectory / Experience -->
		<div class="space-y-6">
			<h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white border-b border-slate-900 pb-2">/ Engineering & R&D Trajectory</h2>
			
			<div class="space-y-6 border-l border-slate-800 pl-6 ml-2">
				
				<div class="space-y-1 relative">
					<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent absolute -left-[29px] top-1.5"></span>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between text-xs">
						<span class="font-bold text-white">MLOps, Computer Vision & Infrastructure Focus</span>
						<span class="text-slate-500">2025 — Present</span>
					</div>
					<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed pt-1">
						Architecting asynchronous ML workload platforms, VLM quantization pipelines (Qwen2.5-VL / vLLM / AWQ), automated CI/CD model quality gates, and ROS 2 perception-to-action control stacks. Completed intensive Deep Learning & Computer Vision specialization at Yandex Practicum (2026).
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="space-y-1 relative">
					<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-700 absolute -left-[29px] top-1.5"></span>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between text-xs">
						<span class="font-bold text-white">Lead Systems & QA Automation Engineer (Datagile / Kaspersky Lab)</span>
						<span class="text-slate-500">Previous Roles</span>
					</div>
					<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed pt-1">
						Designed end-to-end ML pipelines (FastAPI, Docker, Grafana) and built distributed integration testing frameworks for anti-phishing ML services under high load (up to 2.5M operations/day using Python, RabbitMQ, PostgreSQL, Cassandra, and Locust).
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="space-y-1 relative">
					<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-700 absolute -left-[29px] top-1.5"></span>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between text-xs">
						<span class="font-bold text-white">European R&D & Embedded C++ Engineering (Munich, France, Spain)</span>
						<span class="text-slate-500">Academic & Industry R&D</span>
					</div>
					<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed pt-1">
						Developed C++ 3D spatial reconstruction comparison pipelines for intraoperative freehand SPECT navigation at <strong>SurgicEye GmbH</strong> (Munich). Conducted GPU-resident Real-Time Ray Tracing optimization on <strong>CUDA / NVIDIA OptiX</strong> using Morton codes in a joint Master's thesis with <strong>Audi</strong>. Earlier research appointments at <strong>INRIA</strong> (France), <strong>University of León</strong> (Spain, PySpark network traffic analysis), and software engineering at <strong>CST AG</strong> and <strong>John Wiley & Sons</strong>.
					</p>
				</div>

			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Academic Foundation & Publications -->
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
			<div class="bg-slate-900/30 border border-slate-800/80 rounded-lg p-5 space-y-3">
				<div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400">// EDUCATION</div>
				<ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
					<li>
						<div class="font-bold text-white">Technical University of Munich (TUM)</div>
						<div class="text-slate-400">M.Sc. in Computer Vision & Robotics (CAMPAR & Chair of Robotics)</div>
					</li>
					<li>
						<div class="font-bold text-white">Bauman Moscow State Technical University</div>
						<div class="text-slate-400">Specialist / M.Sc. in Optoelectronic Devices & Systems</div>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="bg-slate-900/30 border border-slate-800/80 rounded-lg p-5 space-y-3">
				<div class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-accent">// PUBLICATIONS & OPEN SOURCE</div>
				<ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
					<li>
						<div class="font-bold text-white">IEEE Xplore Research Publication</div>
						<div class="text-slate-400">Peer-reviewed contribution in computational & engineering systems</div>
					</li>
					<li>
						<div class="font-bold text-white">Hugging Face & GitHub Ecosystem</div>
						<div class="text-slate-400">Published specialist YOLO11n detectors and held-out ASL webcam benchmark suites (CC-BY-4.0 / MIT)</div>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Languages & Direct Channels -->
		<div class="bg-slate-900/20 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4">
			<div class="space-y-1 text-xs">
				<div class="text-white font-bold">Languages & Availability</div>
				<div class="text-slate-400">Russian (Native) · English (C2 / Fluent) · German (B2)</div>
			</div>
			<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-xs font-bold">
				<a href="https://t.me" target="_blank" class="bg-brand-accent text-brand-dark px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-sky-400 transition-colors">
					Telegram ↗
				</a>
				<a href="mailto:alexander.jdanoff@gmail.com" class="bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors">
					Email
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

	</section>
</MainLayout>
